sequenceDiagram
 actor R as Reviewer
 participant W as Vercel API
 participant D as Neon Transaction
 participant J as Durable Job
 participant M as Meta Graph
 R->>W: Approve(render_id, sha256)
 W->>D: Check role, licenses, claims, latest revision
 D-->>W: Audit + approval for exact hash
 R->>W: Publish(page_id, copy)
 W->>D: Validate exact approval, budget, access; insert unique publication + outbox
 D-->>W: Accepted job_id (202)
 J->>D: Lease job atomically
 J->>M: Validate page/token and post only if not already remote
 alt known remote id
   M-->>J: status remote
 else new publication
   M-->>J: remote_video_id
 end
 J->>D: commit remote id, status PUBLISHED
 Note over J,M: Uncertain timeout: reconcile before retrying POST
